

  Hello world!!!!!


=+ About us +=

We provide the latest (near-)mainline Linux for the good old MediaTek MT6589 (MT8125/MT8389).
We will also port postmarketOS to Lenovo YOGA Tablet 8/10 (`lenovo-blade`).


=+ Projects +=

-------
 Linux
-------
main work.

https://github.com/TeamYogaBlade2/linux


